==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Rose Garden Witch]] spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**30 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Another easy stage, but if you haven't beaten Empire of Cats Chapter 3, remember to use cats like [[Wall Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to protect against the enemy spam. Otherwise, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is useful for dealing with the large amount of enemies. Additionally, using the combo [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]] can quickly deal with the witch, though it might be a bit overkill.

